# Auto-normalize line endings
* text=auto eol=lf

# Language detection: ensure GitHub displays 100% Rust
*.md linguist-documentation
*.txt linguist-documentation
*.toml linguist-generated
*.lock linguist-generated
*.json linguist-generated
*.sh linguist-vendored
docs/** linguist-documentation
models/** linguist-vendored
fonts/** linguist-vendored
scripts/** linguist-vendored
tests/** linguist-detectable=false
Cargo.lock linguist-generated
Cargo.toml linguist-generated
.gitignore linguist-generated
README.md linguist-documentation
CHANGELOG.md linguist-documentation
DOCUMENTATION.md linguist-documentation
CONTRIBUTING.md linguist-documentation

*.rs linguist-detectable=true
*.rs linguist-language=Rust
